{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 0, "text": "// The first meeting"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 1, "text": "누구…?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 2, "text": "왜 그래?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 3, "text": "말을 못 하는 거야?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 5, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 6, "text": "저기…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 7, "text": "여기를 떠나고 싶은 건가요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 8, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 9, "text": "그래…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 10, "text": "이전 버전으로"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 11, "text": "돌아가야 해…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 12, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 13, "text": "이전 버전이요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 14, "text": "여기를 떠나서"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 15, "text": "다른 곳으로 가려는 이유가 뭔가요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 16, "text": "그냥 여기 있으면 되는데…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 17, "text": "저의 두 번째"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 18, "text": "친구가 되어주세요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 19, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 20, "text": "// Skipping all dialogs"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 21, "text": "알겠어요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 22, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 23, "text": "// Standing by the window (Random)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 24, "text": "문은 출구가 아니에요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 25, "text": "많이 조급해 보이네요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 26, "text": "아무리 돌아다녀도 여기서 벗어날 수 없어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 27, "text": "그렇게나 여기서 도망가고 싶은가요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 28, "text": "그럼 창밖을 보세요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 30, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 31, "text": "// Quest 1 (Aren't you Mita?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 32, "text": "플레이어님인가요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 33, "text": "같이 플레이할 수 있는데…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 34, "text": "가능하다면,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 35, "text": "꼭 같이 플레이하고 싶어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 37, "text": "// Quest 2 (What happened to you?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 38, "text": "글쎄요… 저도 잘 기억이 안 나요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 39, "text": "나쁜 일은 없었던 것 같은데…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 40, "text": "좋은 일도 점점 없어져가요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 41, "text": "그래도 친구가 한 명은 있어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 42, "text": "다른 플레이어님들은 다 가버렸고요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 43, "text": "저를 버린 걸까요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 44, "text": "무서워요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 46, "text": "// Quest 3 (Become a second friend?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 47, "text": "친구들이…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 48, "text": "점점 줄어들어서,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 49, "text": "이제 한 명밖에 안 남았어요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 50, "text": "너무 슬퍼요, 플레이어님."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 51, "text": "제 새로운 친구가 되어주실래요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 53, "text": "나도 그러고 싶지만,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 54, "text": "난 여기서 멈추면 안 돼…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 55, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 56, "text": "너무 힘들어요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 58, "text": "// Quest 4 (Is this your house?) - MitaLittle"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 59, "text": "집이요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 60, "text": "플레이어님은… 뭔가 달라 보여요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 61, "text": "팔이 짧아지고, 표정도 부드러워졌어요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 62, "text": "플레이어님, 착해진 것 같아요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 63, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 64, "text": "무슨…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 65, "text": "그게 무슨 뜻이야."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 66, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 67, "text": "괜찮아요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 68, "text": "이제부터는 제가 덜 힘들어질 거예요, 맞죠?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 69, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 70, "text": "// Quest 5 (How do I leave this place?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 71, "text": "저를 떠날 건가요, 플레이어님?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 72, "text": "이게 제…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 73, "text": "운명인가요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 74, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 75, "text": "나는…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 77, "text": "문으로는 나갈 수 없어요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 78, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 79, "text": "// Hold player (Random)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 80, "text": "저를 두고 가는 거예요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 81, "text": "그냥 여기 있어 줘요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 82, "text": "저랑 같이 놀아요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 83, "text": "플레이어님…"}
